{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/links/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/links/", "title": "Useful Links", "content_html": "<p>Useful links for new and experienced developers:</p>\n<h2>MiSTer FPGA Tutorials</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/alanswx/Tutorials_MiSTer\">Alanswx's MiSTer Tutorials series</a>{t...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/links.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:02:32+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/links/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/links/", "title": "\u4fbf\u5229\u306a\u30ea\u30f3\u30af", "content_html": "<p>\u65b0\u4eba\u30fb\u30d9\u30c6\u30e9\u30f3\u554f\u308f\u305a\u958b\u767a\u8005\u5411\u3051\u306e\u4fbf\u5229\u306a\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\uff1a</p>\n<h2>MiSTer FPGA \u30c1\u30e5\u30fc\u30c8\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/alanswx/Tutorials_MiSTer\">Alanswx's MiSTer Tutorials series</a>{target=_blank}  <br>\n[pram0d's...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/links.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:02:32+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/ini/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/ini/", "title": "INI Settings", "content_html": "<p>The <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Main_MiSTer/blob/master/MiSTer.ini\">MiSTer.ini configuration file</a>{target=_blank} contains global settings, and can also...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/ini.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:57:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/videomodes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/videomodes/", "title": "Video Modes", "content_html": "<p>The <code>#!ini video_mode</code> INI setting supports several ways to specify the video mode.</p>\n<h2>Automatic Detection</h2>\n<p>If no <code>#!ini video_mode</code> setting is specified, Mi...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/videomodes.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:57:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/bluetooth/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/bluetooth/", "title": "Bluetooth", "content_html": "<p>The MiSTer supports Bluetooth adapters and Bluetooth-connected controllers.</p>\n<h2>Compatible adapters</h2>\n<p>Generally speaking, most Bluetooth 4.0 adapters use one ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/bluetooth.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:57:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "title": "FAQ", "content_html": "<p>Answers to frequently asked questions about MiSTer. If something is missing, feel free to contribute by editing this page on GitHub with the Edit (pen) icon ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:57:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/headonsoundpcb/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/headonsoundpcb/", "title": "Head On Sound PCB Implementation", "content_html": "<p><em>Article by MiSTer core developer Jegor van Opdorp (SupraDeus/jopdorp)</em></p>\n<p>This article contains a description of how we implemented the sound PCB of the game ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/headonsoundpcb.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:57:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/ini/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/ini/", "title": "INI\u8a2d\u5b9a", "content_html": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Main_MiSTer/blob/master/MiSTer.ini\">MiSTer.ini \u8a2d\u5b9a\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb</a>{target=_blank}\u306b\u306f\u30b0\u30ed\u30fc\u30d0\u30eb\u8a2d\u5b9a\u304c\u3042\u308a\u3001\u30b3\u30a2\u56fa\u6709\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3082\u4fdd\u5b58\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u307e\u305a\u30b0\u30ed\u30fc\u30d0\u30eb\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3001\u6b21\u306b\u30b3\u30a2\u3054\u3068\u306e\u4e0a\u66f8\u304d...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/ini.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:57:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/videomodes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/videomodes/", "title": "\u30d3\u30c7\u30aa\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9", "content_html": "<p><code>#!ini video_mode</code> INI \u8a2d\u5b9a\u306f\u3001\u30d3\u30c7\u30aa\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u306e\u6307\u5b9a\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u3044\u304f\u3064\u304b\u30b5\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u81ea\u52d5\u691c\u51fa</h2>\n<p><code>#!ini video_mode</code> \u304c\u672a\u6307\u5b9a\u306e\u5834\u5408\u3001MiSTer \u306f\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u6a5f\u5668\u306e EDID \u60c5\u5831\u304b\u3089\u6b63\u3057\u3044\u30d3\u30c7\u30aa\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u306e\u6c7a\u5b9a\u3092\u8a66\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u306f HDMI \u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u63a5\u7d9a\u3055\u308c\u305f\u6a5f\u5668\u306b\u9650...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/videomodes.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:57:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/bluetooth/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/bluetooth/", "title": "Bluetooth", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f Bluetooth \u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc\u3068 Bluetooth \u63a5\u7d9a\u306e\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u5bfe\u5fdc\u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc</h2>\n<p>\u4e00\u822c\u7684\u306b\u3001Bluetooth 4.0 \u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u591a\u304f\u306f CSR8510 \u307e\u305f\u306f BCM20702 \u3068\u3044\u3046\u4f3c\u305f\u30c1\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u3069\u3061\u3089\u304b\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u3066\u304a\u308a\u3001\u3069\u3061\u3089\u3082\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002Blueto...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/bluetooth.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:57:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "title": "\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f\u3078\u306e\u56de\u7b54\u3067\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u304b\u4e0d\u8db3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308c\u3070\u3001\u53f3\u4e0a\u306e Edit\uff08\u30da\u30f3\uff09\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3\u304b\u3089 GitHub \u4e0a\u3067\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u7de8\u96c6\u3057\u3066\u8ca2\u732e\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066</h2>\n<h3>MiSTer \u306e\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u306f\u96e3\u3057\u3044\uff1f \u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3044\u3058\u304f\u308a\u56de\u3059\u306e\u304c\u597d\u304d\u306a\u6280\u8853\u8005\u5411\u3051\u306a\u306e\uff1f</h3>\n<p>\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3001\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3002\u3044\u3058...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:57:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/headonsoundpcb/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/headonsoundpcb/", "title": "Head On\u30b5\u30a6\u30f3\u30c9PCB\u5b9f\u88c5", "content_html": "<p><em>\u8a18\u4e8b\uff1aMiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u958b\u767a\u8005 Jegor van Opdorp\uff08SupraDeus/jopdorp\uff09</em></p>\n<p>\u3053\u306e\u8a18\u4e8b\u3067\u306f\u3001SEGA/Gremlin \u306e\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0 Head On \u306e\u30b5\u30a6\u30f3\u30c9 PCB \u3092\u3069\u3046\u5b9f\u88c5\u3057\u305f\u304b\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u6700\u521d\u306e\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7</h2>\n<p>Head On \u30b5\u30a6\u30f3\u30c9 PCB \u57fa\u677f\u306e\u56de\u8def\u56f3\u3092\u5206\u6790\u3057\u3001\u500b\u3005\u306e...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/headonsoundpcb.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:57:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/nativeres/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/nativeres/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6", "content_html": "<p>\u3053\u306e\u8868\u306f\u5404\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u8d77\u52d5\u6642\u306e\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30cd\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6\u30fb\u5468\u6ce2\u6570\u30fb\u30d4\u30af\u30bb\u30eb\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u793a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u3089\u306e\u5024\u306f\u56fa\u5b9a\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304